{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-11-06T15:02:42Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 大语言模型 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_a7c0395dbe3f8bcc0d170d8f7a3e13e6ef6ef3857fcbc58d354e82699a80f7e2","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-hacker_news-claude-code-sends-your-email-address-to-websites-0-199af8aea5/","observation_id":"obs_199af8aea5b61129022fe080e48927778cfec869ca504d65378933049c27baf7","published_at":"2026-11-05T22:17:15Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Claude Code sends your email address to websites"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d1fb334d50dabd2939a698e52348a32ed767b5af7ed03e4beb97c88eb661747a","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podcasts-getting-started-with-web-answer-on-amazon-bedrock--0-614ec411e8/","observation_id":"obs_614ec411e822a540898f15e570bc65f7c99b1de4d8e763c931bcb2cccaf8f043","published_at":"2026-11-05T21:04:24Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"Amazon Bedrock AgentCore 的 Web Answer 现已正式可用。开发者只需调用一次工具，即可获得基于当前网页信息、由模型综合生成并附带来源链接的回答，无需自行搭建搜索、检索、内容清洗和引用提取流程。","title":"Getting started with Web Answer on Amazon Bedrock AgentCore"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_68cee360942b7e8efa12f49664464d286d4222103c8afad6fa67d9b2060e61b1","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-arxiv-swarmevolve-latent-agent-swarms-for-evolutionary-d-0-6f7078b324/","observation_id":"obs_6f7078b324b1954466218c0ab514603989f805fdd1c106f8621d9fda98e8288f","published_at":"2026-11-05T18:59:29Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"SwarmEvolve 是一种利用大规模智能体群体进行进化式搜索的方法，让智能体在隐空间协作、共享 KV 缓存信息，并结合新颖性筛选与隐式交叉来生成和优化程序。实验显示，它在数学发现与科学计算任务上以更短时间取得了较高平均分。","title":"SwarmEvolve: Latent Agent Swarms for Evolutionary Discovery and Optimization"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_0d40ab33453c1ffd45f8b8479389ebf75d40c8739f45f4bca22caeb204d73530","internal_url":"/posts/20261106-blogs_podca